er-facing conversational surfaces maintained by another team.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Build in safeguards against unsafe or misleading outputs (e.g., stale data, untrusted market/portfolio data, hallucinated financial claims).</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Operate these pipelines and integrations at scale and with the reliability expected of customer-facing financial infrastructure.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Collaborate with product, compliance, and the AI platform team to ship personalized crypto features responsibly.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h2>We are looking for a person who has</h2><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Required</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience building data pipelines and integration layers that connect backend/product data to AI-driven systems (context engineering, tool/function calling) — collaborating with ML engineers rather than owning model training.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Solid understanding of blockchain concepts and crypto products (wallets, portfolios, transactions, on-chain data), with the ability to integrate deeply with protocols and core crypto infrastructure.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience working with customer data and behavior to drive personalization (segmentation, risk profiling, usage patterns).</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Strong distributed-systems fundamentals — experience designing and operating data pipelines and services at scale (throughput, consistency, failure handling, freshness, reliability), rather than expertise tied to a specific programming language.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Comfort working as a cross-team interface — translating a platform team's integration needs into clear data contracts and APIs.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Awareness of the risks of exposing financial data to LLM-driven surfaces (data integrity, injection risks, appropriate guardrails).</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Nice to have</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience with specific blockchain protocols (Ethereum, Bitcoin, Solana) and their data/integration patterns.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Prior work integrating with RAG systems or agent tooling in a regulated or high-stakes domain.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience in fintech, payments, or financial services with personalization or recommendation systems.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Familiarity with vector databases, embeddings, or context-retrieval infrastructure.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience partnering with conversational AI or LLM platform teams as a data provider.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Location:</strong> Palo Alto, United States</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Our recruitment process may involve the use of artificial intelligence–enabled tools, such as automated interview transcription and analysis, to support the evaluation process. Artificial intelligence is not used to make final hiring decisions; all decisions are made by human reviewers.<br /><br />To maintain a consistent and fair process for every candidate, Nu does not provide individualized technical feedback. See how our policy works <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://script.google.com/a/macros/nubank.com.br/s/AKfycbwvrewE58oGSbRWIVv8CyCWN68GLxpPVsfYYXv-ZHg94QFsTJmi82rF1x0yt-OTs2W0DQ/exec">here</a></p>","descriptionPlain":"ABOUT NU

