YOU’LL BE RESPONSIBLE FOR 



• Strategically planning and managing long-term liquidity and funding structure, interest rate risk of the banking book (IRRBB), and the funds transfer pricing (FTP) framework.

• Solving advanced analytical problems using data, experience, and tools.

• Developing a global financial view of Nubank's business as a whole.

• Supporting liquidity and funding management for national and international operations.

• Collaborating with team members and other teams in a constructive and data-driven manner.

 


WHAT WE'RE LOOKING FOR SOMEONE WHO HAS

Required

