e AI &amp; Modern Tooling:</strong> Responsibly integrate AI copilots and automated workflows into daily analytics to increase speed and decision quality.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Align Cross-Functional Partners:</strong> Collaborate with Product, Engineering, Legal, and Compliance to assess the commercial and operational impact of regulatory updates and business strategy.</p></li></ul><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px"> </div><h2><em><strong>What We're Looking For </strong></em></h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Analytical Capacity &amp; Rigor:</strong> Strong foundation in quantitative analysis, probability, statistical modeling, and financial mechanics applied to complex business problems.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Experimentation &amp; Causal Inference:</strong> Hands-on experience designing controlled A/B tests, measuring statistical significance, and establishing guardrail metrics.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Technical &amp; Tooling Proficiency:</strong> Advanced SQL and Python skills for data extraction, manipulation, and pipeline development.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Product &amp; Strategic Thinking:</strong> Experience working alongside product managers and engineers in an iterative, fast-paced product development environment.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Executive Communication:</strong> Proven ability to translate complex quantitative findings into concise, compelling data stories that influence stakeholders.<br /><br /><strong>Our Benefits:</strong><br />Opportunity of earning equity at Nu<br />• Medical Insurance<br />• Dental and Vision Insurance<br />• Life Insurance and AD&amp;D<br />• Extended maternity and paternity leaves<br />• Nucleo - Our learning platform of courses<br />• NuLanguage - Our language learning program<br />• NuCare - Our mental health and wellness assistance