alist legal business partner for new businesses in Latin America, coordinating a holistic legal approach, including support on agreements related to our products.</p></li></ul><h3><strong>We are looking for someone who has</strong></h3><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Qualified as a lawyer, holding the local bar license in the country where you will be based.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">In-house experience at a fintech, payments, crypto/digital-assets or banking company, where you personally worked through regulatory, licensing and market-entry questions in Latin America.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Hands-on experience with payments regulation and licensing, and with digital assets, crypto, stablecoins or blockchain-based financial products.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience analyzing and comparing regulatory regimes across several Latin American jurisdictions, not a single-country specialty, with familiarity with the South American regulatory landscape.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">A solid understanding of how payments, banking, securities, FX and digital-asset regulation interact.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience taking part in obtaining or maintaining financial-services, payments or digital-asset licenses or registrations.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience breaking down complex product architectures and money flows to pinpoint the core regulatory question, and the judgment built along the way to know when to escalate, bring in external counsel or engage a regulator, and when the business can simply move forward.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">A track record of briefing senior legal and business leaders on technical regulatory topics, turning them into clear, actionable recommendations.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience as a senior, autonomous legal partner to Product and business teams in fast-moving environments, owning ambiguous problems and finding a compliant path forward instead of only flagging risks.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Fluent English and Spanish.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Nice to have</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Direct work with financial regulators or central banks, or prior experience at a financial-regulatory law firm, central bank or regulator.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience in regulatory policy for digital assets and payments.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Banking or credit regulatory background combined with curiosity about digital assets.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Familiarity with additional Latin American markets.</p></li></ul><h3><strong>Location for this opportunity</strong></h3><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Buenos Aires, Argentina</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">São Paulo, Brazil</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Bogotá, Colombia</p></li></ul><h3><strong>Our Benefits</strong></h3><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Brazil</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Chance of earning equity at Nubank</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Food/ Meal Card (Vale-Refeição and/or Vale Alimentação)</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Public Transportation Commuting Benefit (Vale-Transporte)</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">NuCare – Psychological, Financial and Legal Assistance Program</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Life Insurance</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Medical Plan</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Dental Plan</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">NuLanguage – Language Course Program</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Nucleo - Our learning platform of courses</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Extended Parental Leave</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Daycare Allowance</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Parental Consultancy</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Work-from-home Allowance</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Gym Partnerships</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">30 days of paid vacation</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Relocation Assistance Package, if applicable</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h3><strong>Work Model for this Role</strong></h3><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Hybrid 2-3 times/week</strong>: Our hybrid work model brings us to the office at least twice a week, on strategic days designed to maximize team connection and collaboration. For more details, visit <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="https://building.nubank.com/nu-hybrid-work-model/"><u>https://building.nubank.com/nu-hybrid-work-model/</u></a></p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Our recruitment process may involve the use of artificial intelligence–enabled tools, such as automated interview transcription and analysis, to support the evaluation process. Artificial intelligence is not used to make final hiring decisions; all decisions are made by human reviewers.<br /><br />To maintain a consistent and fair process for every candidate, Nu does not provide individualized technical feedback. See how our policy works <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://script.google.com/a/macros/nubank.com.br/s/AKfycbwvrewE58oGSbRWIVv8CyCWN68GLxpPVsfYYXv-ZHg94QFsTJmi82rF1x0yt-OTs2W0DQ/exec">here</a></p>","descriptionPlain":"ABOUT NU

